    "text": "By Hunter Dawkins ,\n1 days ago PRCC CAMPUS (GG) — Several Coast Electric employees spent a morning alongside students in the Pearl River Community College (PRCC) Utility Lineman program. From paying close attention to all personal protective equipment to witnessing what can happen when items touch the line, the morning focused on safety and what to expect in the field. Read full article",
